{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ribbit Ranch is a cozy idle game where you unwind while you collect and care for frogs. Raise these frogs and sell for them for a profit or keep them around to use in mini-games, breeding and to passively generate money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/3aab0e91f7ada4dfe6f7f2cb727fe9f2.avif?t=1757833414\" width=580 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open packs to get rare frog combinations! Be on the lookout for ultra-rare golden frogs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/630e4281018bd239e7460dd31b223566.poster.avif?t=1757833414\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/630e4281018bd239e7460dd31b223566.webm?t=1757833414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/83f9e0384dff57301838a0589da8b146.avif?t=1757833414\" width=580 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your frogs by feeding them, and decide to keep them or sell them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/10cb3f369309df3b3daf2dc22071fe05.poster.avif?t=1757833414\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/10cb3f369309df3b3daf2dc22071fe05.webm?t=1757833414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/020809f95d59de106840231b174a5aeb.avif?t=1757833414\" width=580 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new frogs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/b05677170c8b1c9bbb65024443c37554.poster.avif?t=1757833414\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/b05677170c8b1c9bbb65024443c37554.webm?t=1757833414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A big thank you for supporting my first Steam title! As a solo developer I truly appreciate everyone who has supported the game. Please consider Wishlisting this game if you are even just a little bit interested!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754430?t=1757833414","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754430?t=1757833414","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/817f3ab516593f5b3487ba5e1a9f78dbb7054860/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757833414","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/817f3ab516593f5b3487ba5e1a9f78dbb7054860/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757833414","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3928690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/8318c4fb809392a37a2dec745e0c0464.avif?t=1757833414\" width=580 height=100 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ribbit Ranch is a cozy idle game where you unwind while you collect and care for frogs. Raise these frogs and sell for them for a profit or keep them around to use in mini-games, breeding and to passively generate money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/3aab0e91f7ada4dfe6f7f2cb727fe9f2.avif?t=1757833414\" width=580 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open packs to get rare frog combinations! Be on the lookout for ultra-rare golden frogs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/630e4281018bd239e7460dd31b223566.poster.avif?t=1757833414\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/630e4281018bd239e7460dd31b223566.webm?t=1757833414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/83f9e0384dff57301838a0589da8b146.avif?t=1757833414\" width=580 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your frogs by feeding them, and decide to keep them or sell them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/10cb3f369309df3b3daf2dc22071fe05.poster.avif?t=1757833414\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/10cb3f369309df3b3daf2dc22071fe05.webm?t=1757833414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/020809f95d59de106840231b174a5aeb.avif?t=1757833414\" width=580 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new frogs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/b05677170c8b1c9bbb65024443c37554.poster.avif?t=1757833414\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/b05677170c8b1c9bbb65024443c37554.webm?t=1757833414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A big thank you for supporting my first Steam title! As a solo developer I truly appreciate everyone who has supported the game. Please consider Wishlisting this game if you are even just a little bit interested!</p>","developers":["Jack McAllister"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id"